      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "The end of detailed summarized thinking traces for Claude and ChatGPT (likely both for anti-distillation & to simplify UX) has made being a human in the loop challenging. It pushes us towards automation, rather than augmentation, as it has become much harder to weigh in on in-process AI work.",
